# Shared project context

Before working in this repository, read and follow `AGENTS.md` and
`docs/00-project-context.md` (paths relative to the repository root).

This environment is a research instrument for measuring, explaining and
modifying agent behavior, not a generic framework or banking product. Prefer
small closed experimental loops and reproducible evidence. RL is a possible
intervention, not a prerequisite or checkbox.

Use the shared documents for the complete startup, Engram, evidence and
authorization rules. Keep this adapter thin; update the canonical context
rather than maintaining a separate Cursor-only strategy. The conceptual
roadmap is not authorization to execute it.
